OL,3,GNEWSA18th Century country house hotel
OL,4,Aset for new life after bookings hit
OL,5,A'negligible level'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA historic country house hotel in the
OL,8,Fsouth of Scotland is seeking a new use
OL,9,Fafter its future bookings reached a
OL,10,F"negligible level".
OL,12,FPlans have been lodged to convert the
OL,13,FTrigony House Hotel near Thornhill -
OL,14,Fwhich dates back to at least the 18th
OL,15,FCentury - into a private home.
OL,17,FA statement submitted with the
OL,18,Fproposals said the decision had been
OL,19,Fmade after a period of "very
OL,20,Fsignificant trading losses" with future
OL,21,Fbookings on an "even more downward
OL,22,Ftrend".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
