OL,3,GNEWSA18th Century country house hotel
OL,4,Aset for new life after bookings hit
OL,5,A'negligible level'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt added that the use of the hotel had
OL,8,Fbeen at such levels that its conversion
OL,9,Fwould not mean there was "any loss of
OL,10,Fcommunity facility".
